        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5\nskinparam roundcorner 5\n\nactor \&quot;: BacSi\&quot; as BS\nboundary \&quot;: FrmKeToaThuoc\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;: ToaThuocService\&quot; as SVC\nentity \&quot;: HoSoBenhAn\&quot; as HS\nentity \&quot;: Thuoc\&quot; as TH\nentity \&quot;: ToaThuoc\&quot; as TOA\nentity \&quot;: ChiTietToaThuoc\&quot; as CTT\n\nBS -&gt; UI : MoForm(maPK, maHoSo)\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; SVC : LayTienSuDiUng(maHoSo)\nactivate SVC\nSVC -&gt; HS : layTienSuPhanUngThuoc()\nactivate HS\nHS --&gt; SVC : dsThuocDiUng\ndeactivate HS\nSVC --&gt; UI : dsThuocDiUng\ndeactivate SVC\n\nUI -&gt; SVC : LayDanhSachThuoc()\nactivate SVC\nSVC -&gt; TH : layThuocKhaDung()\nactivate TH\nTH --&gt; SVC : dsThuoc\ndeactivate TH\nSVC --&gt; UI : dsThuoc\ndeactivate SVC\n\nBS -&gt; UI : ChonThuoc, nhapSoLuong, lieuLuong, cachDung, loiDan\nBS -&gt; UI : Nhan \&quot;Lap toa thuoc\&quot;\n\nUI -&gt; SVC : KeToaThuoc(maToa, maPK, maHoSo, loiDan, dsChiTiet)\nactivate SVC\n\nSVC -&gt; SVC : KiemTraDiUng(dsChiTiet, dsThuocDiUng)\n\nalt du lieu khong hop le hoac thuoc bi di ung\n    SVC --&gt; UI : KetQuaXuLy.Fail(\&quot;Thuoc co tien su phan ung phu!\&quot;)\n    UI --&gt; BS : Canh bao thuoc di ung, yeu cau doi thuoc\nelse hop le - trong 1 transaction\n    SVC -&gt; TOA : taoToaThuoc(maToa, maPK, SYSDATETIME(), loiDan, tongTien)\n    activate TOA\n    TOA --&gt; SVC : ok\n    deactivate TOA\n\n    loop moi thuoc trong dsChiTiet\n        SVC -&gt; CTT : themChiTiet(maToa, maThuoc, soLuong, lieuLuong, cachDung, donGia)\n        activate CTT\n        CTT --&gt; SVC : ok\n        deactivate CTT\n    end\n\n    SVC -&gt; SVC : Commit()\n    SVC --&gt; UI : KetQuaXuLy.Ok(\&quot;Da lap toa thuoc thanh cong.\&quot;)\n    deactivate SVC\n    UI --&gt; BS : Thong bao ket qua; ho tro in toa thuoc\nend\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="P_-f_cGkMf5SzH0zFgur-261">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
